# REGENT OF BUTON

# PROVINCE OF SOUTHEAST SULAWESI

# REGIONAL REGULATION OF BUTON REGENCY

# NUMBER 6 OF 2021

# CONCERNING

# IMPLEMENTATION OF PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND

# CHILD VICTIMS OF VIOLENCE

# BY THE GRACE OF GOD ALMIGHTY

# REGENT OF BUTON,

Considering:  
a. that women and children are vulnerable groups who tend to experience torture and violence and therefore must receive protection;  
b. that to provide direction, foundation and legal certainty to all parties in the implementation of protection for women and children in Buton Regency, regulation is necessary;  
c. that based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, and letter b, it is necessary to establish a Regional Regulation concerning Implementation of Protection for Women and Child Victims of Violence;  

In View of 1. Article 18 paragraph (6) of the 1945 Constitution of the Republic of Indonesia;  

2. Law Number 29 of 1959 concerning Formation of Level II Regions in Sulawesi (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1959 Number 74, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 1822);  
3. Law Number 4 of 1979 concerning Child Welfare (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1979 Number 32, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3243);  
4. Law Number 39 of 1999 concerning Human Rights (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 1999 Number 165, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3835);  

2 ­

5. Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2002 Number 109, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4235), as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 17 of 2016 concerning Stipulation of Government Regulation in Lieu of Law Number 1 of 2016 concerning Second Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2002 concerning Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2016 Number 99, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5882);  

6 Law Number 23 of 2004 concerning Elimination of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2004 Number 95, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4419);  

7. Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning Formation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2011 Number 82, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5234), as has been amended by Law Number 15 of 2019 concerning Amendment to Law Number 12 of 2011 concerning Formation of Legislation (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2019 Number 183, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6398);  
8. Law Number 11 of 2012 concerning Juvenile Justice System (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2012 Number 297, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5332);  
9. Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2014 Number 244, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5587), as has been amended several times most recently by Law Number 9 of 2015 concerning Second Amendment to Law Number 23 of 2014 concerning Regional Government (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 58, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 5679);  

10, Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 80 of 2015 concerning Formation of Regional Legal Products State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2015 Number 2036), as has been amended by Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 120 of 2018 concerning Amendment to Regulation of the Minister of Home Affairs Number 80 of 2015 concerning Formation of Regional Legal Products (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2018 Number 157);  

3 ­

11. Regional Regulation of Buton Regency Number 2 of 2016 concerning Government Affairs Which Are the Authority of the Buton Regency Government as an Autonomous Region (Regional Gazette of Buton Regency of 2016 Number 112)
12. Regional Regulation of Buton Regency Number 6 of 2016 concerning Formation and Composition of Regional Apparatus of Buton Regency (Regional Gazette of Buton Regency of 2016 Number 116), as has been amended by Regional Regulation of Buton Regency Number 4 of 2019 concerning Amendment to Regional Regulation of Buton Regency Number 6 of 2016 concerning Formation and Composition of Regional Apparatus of Buton Regency (Regional Gazette of Buton Regency of 2019 Number 146);  

